<title>NEW ZEALAND: S&amp;P affirms NZ sovereign debt ratings.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P affirms NZ sovereign debt ratings.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp on Tuesday affirmed New Zealand's AA plus foreign currency and AAA local currency ratings for long term debt.</p>
<p>The country's short term debt rating of A-1 plus was also affirmed. The agency also said the outlook on the long term ratings remains stable.</p>
</text>
